  "description": "Entity Framework Core-backed IEncryptionKeyStore for Vellum envelope encryption. Provider-agnostic at runtime — the consumer chooses SQL Server, PostgreSQL, SQLite, or any other EF Core provider. Enforces a one-active-key-per-scope invariant via a filtered unique index and handles creation races via DbUpdateException and winner re-read.",
